use firn/tags

protonvpn-gui is a Module
protonvpn-gui is tagged vpn

nix module
  arguments: config, lib, pkgs, ...
  config when config.myConfig.modules.protonvpn-gui.enable
    "environment"
      "systemPackages": [pkgs.unstable.proton-vpn]
  option "myConfig"."modules"."protonvpn-gui"."enable": enable "ProtonVPN GUI client"
